  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35733968",
      "title": "Reflecting The Current Navigation State in the UI",
      "sourceHash": "9eb2c73af3482ac653255f5f3466fa8c9c6837c772a893a7e4cc23a2c8e92cfc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.92,
          "en": "So, how could we give the user some feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.92,
          "end": 8.613,
          "en": "that something's going on here after clicking on Events?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.72,
          "end": 12.33,
          "en": "Well, React Router gives us a special hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.33,
          "end": 13.65,
          "en": "which we can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.65,
          "end": 16.98,
          "en": "to check the current route transitions state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.98,
          "end": 20.22,
          "en": "So, to find out if a transition has been initiated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.22,
          "end": 23.67,
          "en": "and we're currently still waiting for data to arrive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.67,
          "end": 24.903,
          "en": "or if we're done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.98,
          "end": 29.04,
          "en": "Now, we could go to the Root Layout component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.04,
          "end": 31.68,
          "en": "and there we can use the use Navigation hook;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.68,
          "end": 34.38,
          "en": "which is a hook provided by React Router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.38,
          "end": 35.88,
          "en": "that lets us find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.88,
          "end": 38.94,
          "en": "whether we're currently in an active transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.94,
          "end": 40.05,
          "en": "if we're loading data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.05,
          "end": 43.023,
          "en": "or if we have no active transition going on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.4,
          "end": 48.24,
          "en": "We get a Navigation object when we call use Navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.24,
          "end": 51.39,
          "en": "and that Navigation object has a couple of properties;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.39,
          "end": 54.453,
          "en": "but for us, the state property is the most important one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.65,
          "end": 58.47,
          "en": "This is simply a string which is either idle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.47,
          "end": 60.48,
          "en": "loading, or submitting;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.48,
          "end": 62.28,
          "en": "depending on whether we don't have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.28,
          "end": 64.29,
          "en": "any active route transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.29,
          "end": 66.27,
          "en": "if we're having an active transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.27,
          "end": 67.59,
          "en": "and we're loading data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.59,
          "end": 69.18,
          "en": "or if we're submitting data;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.18,
          "end": 71.48,
          "en": "which is something we'll take a look at later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.469,
          "end": 77.16,
          "en": "With that, we could add a Loading text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.16,
          "end": 79.05,
          "en": "in our main section, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.05,
          "end": 82.62,
          "en": "which is only shown if navigation dot state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.62,
          "end": 85.2,
          "en": "is equal to loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.2,
          "end": 86.033,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.63,
          "end": 88.86,
          "en": "With that added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.86,
          "end": 91.59,
          "en": "if we go to Home and back to Events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 91.59,
          "end": 93.3,
          "en": "you see that Loading text here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.3,
          "end": 96.75,
          "en": "which signals to the user that we are loading data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.75,
          "end": 98.97,
          "en": "So, which gives the user some feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.97,
          "end": 100.95,
          "en": "that something is happening.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.95,
          "end": 104.253,
          "en": "And this happens every time we go to this All Events page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.47999999999999,
          "end": 107.91,
          "en": "Now, of course, the styling is not perfect here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 107.91,
          "end": 110.72999999999999,
          "en": "It might be nicer to add a little loading bar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.72999999999999,
          "end": 112.65,
          "en": "at the top, or anything like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.65,
          "end": 115.89,
          "en": "but that is how it, theoretically, works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.89,
          "end": 117.36,
          "en": "Now, I'm going to get rid of it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 117.36,
          "end": 120.18,
          "en": "because we'll actually learn about a different solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 120.18,
          "end": 122.01,
          "en": "later in this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 122.01,
          "end": 123.96,
          "en": "but this is one way of finding out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 123.96,
          "end": 126.63,
          "en": "whether you are currently waiting for data or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.63,
          "end": 130.8,
          "en": "and how you could bring back such a loading indicator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 130.8,
          "end": 133.02,
          "en": "It's just important to recognize",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 133.02,
          "end": 135.96,
          "en": "that the loading indicator won't be added on the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 135.96,
          "end": 137.85,
          "en": "which you're transitioning to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 137.85,
          "end": 140.37,
          "en": "but instead on some page, or a component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 140.37,
          "end": 142.68,
          "en": "which is already visible on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 142.68,
          "end": 145.05,
          "en": "when the transition is started.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 145.05,
          "end": 147.81,
          "en": "That's different compared to what we had before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 147.81,
          "end": 150.78300000000002,
          "en": "with use Effect and a separate loading state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 152.01,
          "end": 153.51,
          "en": "Now with all that done, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 153.51,
          "end": 156.52,
          "en": "I will go back and remove this Timeout here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 157.53,
          "end": 159.06,
          "en": "on the back end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 159.06,
          "end": 160.2,
          "en": "and move back to the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 160.2,
          "end": 162.32999999999998,
          "en": "we had originally on that back end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 162.32999999999998,
          "end": 165.81,
          "en": "because I, now, no longer wanna simulate this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 165.81,
          "end": 168.36,
          "en": "Therefore, I also restart the back end server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 168.36,
          "end": 171.003,
          "en": "and we can now dive back into the front end code.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}